WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.350
Customers: one case per person, with the conversation, forms, media, notes and timeline in one place. The list shows each customer's stage, tags, source and last activity.

2
00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:25.160
Search by name, username, city, tag or case number, and filter to Mine, an overdue task, one source or one team member.

3
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:37.170
Click a customer to open their case: overview, conversation, forms, notes and timeline. The overview shows the lead score, why, and the next step.

4
00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:45.500
Switch between List and Board, keep any filtered view with Save this view, and take it out with Export to Excel.
